{
  "name": "Villa Missed Call Recovery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MISSED CALL RECOVERY\n\n**Trigger:** Twilio's <Dial action=...> POSTs here after every forwarded call attempt to the owner, whether answered or not.\n\n**Logic:** if DialCallStatus is anything other than 'completed' (i.e. no-answer, busy, failed), the caller gets an automatic WhatsApp message from the villa's number. If the owner DID answer, nothing happens.\n\n**Twilio Console setup (done once, outside n8n):**\nThe villa's Twilio number -> Voice Configuration -> A call comes in -> TwiML Bin containing:\n<Response><Dial timeout=\"25\" action=\"<this webhook's production URL>\" method=\"POST\">+91XXXXXXXXXX</Dial></Response>\nReplace +91XXXXXXXXXX with the number calls should ring (owner's real mobile for testing).\n\n**Per-client setup -> edit the 'Check Call Status' node only:**\n- villaName\n- twilioFrom (same Twilio WhatsApp number used in the main booking workflow)\n\n**Secrets:** reconnect the Twilio HTTP Basic Auth credential after import.\n\n**This webhook must return TwiML (XML), not JSON** — it's answering Twilio's voice call flow, not a regular API caller.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "80b7c96b-6bf2-5dfa-1808-3880f199ff63",
      "name": "READ ME FIRST"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "villa-missed-call",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        0
      ],
      "id": "939ec534-34c4-7d45-5d56-825f36235666",
      "name": "Missed Call Webhook",
      "webhookId": "villa-missed-call-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ===== PER-CLIENT CONFIG - edit these two =====\nconst villaName = 'Whispering Pines Estate';\nconst twilioFrom = 'whatsapp:+REPLACE_TWILIO_WHATSAPP_NUMBER';\n// ================================================\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst dialCallStatus = (body.DialCallStatus || '').toString();\nconst callerNumber = (body.From || '').toString();\nconst dialedNumber = (body.To || '').toString();\nconst callSid = (body.CallSid || '').toString();\nreturn [{ json: { dialCallStatus, callerNumber, dialedNumber, callSid, villaName, twilioFrom } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -360,
        0
      ],
      "id": "03780090-e355-601e-e4d9-b11210c8cdbe",
      "name": "Check Call Status"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-not-completed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.dialCallStatus }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -160,
        0
      ],
      "id": "6d671408-964f-2599-6b75-ee1517d77f33",
      "name": "Was It Missed?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/REPLACE_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID/Messages.json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "From",
              "value": "={{ $json.twilioFrom }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "To",
              "value": "=whatsapp:{{ $json.callerNumber }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Body",
              "value": "=Hi! Sorry we missed your call 🙏 I'm Maya, {{ $json.villaName }}'s booking assistant — how can I help?"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "retry": {
            "retry": {
              "maxTries": 3,
              "waitBetweenTries": 2000
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        60,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "3e4b7846-13ca-254b-4ab0-48aa5ba9527b",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp Recovery Message",
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Twilio HTTP Basic Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "=<Response></Response>",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "id": "b2ab5f19-bdc0-b85f-f28b-167791d2519b",
      "name": "Respond Empty TwiML"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Missed Call Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Call Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Call Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
